Obtained by using a [[Meal From the Beak of a Night Harpy]] on a [[Bottle of Raubritter Lager]]. Using it gives some positive effect against [[Night Harpy|Night Harpies]] on the [[Isle of Ada]]. The timer counts down even if the player is offline.
<br/>When used, the following message appears: {{Server Message|A delightful brew, extra spicy and with an invigorating aftertaste! The night harpies should have a harder time with you for the next four hours.}}
<br/>When it expires, the following message appears: {{Server Message|The effects of the Night Harpy Lager fade.}}

